  "prefLabel": "Rev 1601.02 Agent",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 1601.02 “Agent” means a person who has the authority to act on behalf of another person, or a person who could be reasonably inferred by others to represent another person.\n\nSource. #13553, eff 2-7-23",
